crates/sky-types/tests/ui/err_for_iterable.sky:2:10: error: cannot iterate over a dimensionless number
  |
2 | for x in n:
  |          ^ this is dimensionless
  = note: only vectors and matrices have elements to loop over
  = help: to repeat something that many times, write `for i in range(n):`

crates/sky-types/tests/ui/err_for_iterable.sky:4:10: error: cannot iterate over a length
  |
4 | for x in 3 m:
  |          ^^^ this is length
  = note: only vectors and matrices have elements to loop over
  = help: loop over a vector, a matrix or `range(n)`

crates/sky-types/tests/ui/err_for_iterable.sky:6:10: error: cannot iterate over a Bool
  |
6 | for x in true:
  |          ^^^^ this is Bool
  = note: only vectors and matrices have elements to loop over
  = help: loop over a vector, a matrix or `range(n)`

crates/sky-types/tests/ui/err_for_iterable.sky:8:10: error: cannot iterate over a string
  |
8 | for x in "abc":
  |          ^^^^^ this is a string
  = note: in v0.1 a string is only printed; it has no elements to loop over
  = help: loop over a vector, a matrix or `range(n)`

crates/sky-types/tests/ui/err_for_iterable.sky:12:10: error: cannot iterate over function `f`
   |
12 | for x in f:
   |          ^ this is a function
   = note: only vectors and matrices have elements to loop over
   = help: call it to get a value, or loop over `range(n)`
